  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2000-06-14T00:00:00Z\"\u003e14 June 2000\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Response to Maurice Williamson claims\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Trevor Mallard\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Education\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Maori Council put to the Government a number of proposals.\u0026#34;  \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;None of those proposals were accepted.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The proposals by the Maori Council were supersceded by the Cabinet decision on Monday 15 May and therefore Maurice Williamson has been dealing with outdated material.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "\"The Maori Council put to the Government a number of proposals.\" \"None of those proposals were accepted.\" \"The proposals by the Maori Council were supersceded by the Cabinet decision on Monday 15 May and therefore Maurice Williamson has been dealing with outdated material.\"",
